<title>UK: Laporte says interest in U.S. adhesives.</title>
<headline>Laporte says interest in U.S. adhesives.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>British specialty chemicals group Laporte Plc said on Monday that it was considering some early approaches from potential buyers for its North American adhesives operations.</p>
<p>In a telephone interview with Reuters, chief executive Jim Leng said &quot;we are looking at some initial expressions of interest for North American adhesives.&quot;</p>
</text>
